WEBVTT

01:29.690 --> 01:33.170
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.650 --> 01:36.200
[Episode 20]

01:36.520 --> 01:37.990
Mr. Liu threatened me,

01:38.280 --> 01:39.570
saying that witnessing this

01:39.570 --> 01:41.170
would surely bring me death.

01:41.200 --> 01:42.479
If I wanted to stay alive,

01:42.479 --> 01:44.080
I had to do exactly as he said.

01:44.280 --> 01:45.160
My Lady,

01:45.160 --> 01:46.840
I truly feared death,

01:47.330 --> 01:49.850
so I had no choice
but to hide the truth from you.

01:49.850 --> 01:51.170
Is what you said true?

01:52.060 --> 01:55.120
It was my father who killed Nian'an.

01:55.440 --> 01:58.509
My Lady,
this is a matter of great importance.

01:58.530 --> 02:01.370
I can only tell you exactly
what I saw and heard.

02:02.270 --> 02:04.010
As for the truth,

02:04.240 --> 02:06.570
I dare not make any reckless assumptions.

02:07.680 --> 02:09.560
What do you mean ''reckless assumptions''?

02:09.560 --> 02:10.759
Isn't it obvious?

02:14.780 --> 02:15.820
I never thought

02:18.200 --> 02:20.720
that the culprit who killed my husband

02:21.550 --> 02:23.210
would actually be my father.

02:33.329 --> 02:36.310
I have failed you, Nian'an.

02:37.490 --> 02:39.090
My Lady! My Lady!

02:39.490 --> 02:41.160
My Lady, are you alright?

02:41.180 --> 02:43.240
What's the point of ending your own life?

02:43.240 --> 02:45.329
It might bring momentary relief
and put an end to everything,

02:45.329 --> 02:47.590
but Shen Nian'an would have died in vain.

02:47.710 --> 02:49.710
Even if I'm resentful, what can I do?

02:50.360 --> 02:51.600
He is my father.

02:51.650 --> 02:52.980
Your father killed him,

02:53.310 --> 02:54.950
and made you marry a monster.

02:55.000 --> 02:56.740
Are you willing to be manipulated by him
for the rest of your life,

02:56.740 --> 02:58.000
living in the shadows?

02:58.040 --> 02:59.360
Then what should I do?

02:59.480 --> 03:00.970
You are yourself first.

03:01.120 --> 03:02.850
Only then are you someone's wife,

03:02.850 --> 03:04.180
or someone's daughter.

03:04.690 --> 03:05.490
Remember:

03:06.300 --> 03:07.670
For your own sake,

03:07.920 --> 03:08.780
the edge of your blade

03:08.780 --> 03:10.580
should be firmly aimed outward.

03:11.320 --> 03:13.380
Make those who ruined your happiness

03:14.210 --> 03:15.530
pay the price.

03:17.540 --> 03:18.710
For myself?

03:19.150 --> 03:19.790
Yes.

03:20.329 --> 03:21.210
For yourself.

03:22.040 --> 03:25.480
Weakness and submission only make
the wicked more unscrupulous.

03:25.480 --> 03:26.390
Jingjing.

03:26.640 --> 03:28.500
Stand up when you're done crying.

03:28.670 --> 03:30.440
Take the knife they gave you

03:30.750 --> 03:32.750
and strike hard at their weak spots.

03:39.840 --> 03:40.800
Exactly.

03:41.840 --> 03:43.280
I want revenge.

03:45.100 --> 03:47.880
[Prime Minister's Mansion]

03:49.530 --> 03:50.329
Father.

03:52.760 --> 03:54.079
The Lantern Festival is coming soon.

03:54.079 --> 03:55.440
I would like to go to the temple
to pray for blessings.

03:55.440 --> 03:56.640
Pray for blessings?

03:56.920 --> 03:57.880
Why?

03:57.880 --> 03:59.920
Father, I have figured it out.

04:00.000 --> 04:02.040
Some things are already set in stone.

04:02.040 --> 04:03.760
Let the past be the past.

04:03.870 --> 04:05.710
It is time to put an end to this.

04:05.800 --> 04:08.600
I agree to the marriage
you arranged for me.

04:08.730 --> 04:10.690
So I want to visit the temple,

04:10.720 --> 04:12.920
consider it fulfilling a vow
on your behalf.

04:12.920 --> 04:15.600
Jingjing, I'm glad you've come around.

04:17.370 --> 04:20.769
Father, after all,
this is my marriage to Mr. Liu,

04:20.959 --> 04:22.840
I would like to invite him to join me.

04:22.840 --> 04:23.640
All right.

04:25.000 --> 04:27.080
Jingjing has finally changed her mind.

04:27.080 --> 04:29.840
I'll leave this matter for you to handle.

04:30.920 --> 04:31.280
Yes.

04:31.640 --> 04:33.280
I will go right away.

04:53.300 --> 04:53.900
Hey.

04:54.240 --> 04:55.480
Why did we stop?

04:55.750 --> 05:00.550
[Tea]

04:57.400 --> 04:59.310
Mr. Liu, my lady is thirsty,

04:59.400 --> 05:00.750
and wants to go in for some tea.

05:00.750 --> 05:01.630
Tea?

05:02.600 --> 05:03.690
Aren't we almost there?

05:03.690 --> 05:07.570
[Tea]

05:03.850 --> 05:05.210
My lady feels a bit tight in the chest.

05:05.210 --> 05:06.560
There happens to be a teahouse here.

05:06.560 --> 05:08.690
She'd like to take a short rest inside.

05:10.390 --> 05:11.570
Fine.

05:11.600 --> 05:12.360
Hmph.

05:13.770 --> 05:15.700
[Tea]

05:16.930 --> 05:19.910
I think I've been to this teahouse before.

05:26.800 --> 05:27.680
Jingjing?

05:30.680 --> 05:31.480
Jingjing?

05:35.280 --> 05:36.080
Jingjing?

05:37.040 --> 05:37.800
Hey.

05:38.040 --> 05:39.400
Where did she go?

05:46.300 --> 05:46.700
You...

05:47.200 --> 05:48.640
Who are you?

05:48.680 --> 05:50.540
Seems you recovered from that hit

05:51.080 --> 05:52.360
pretty quickly.

05:57.770 --> 05:58.690
Oh.

05:59.080 --> 06:00.470
It was you that night.

06:00.880 --> 06:01.800
Just you wait.

06:08.810 --> 06:09.740
Get out of my way!

06:09.750 --> 06:10.990
Do you know who I am?

06:11.340 --> 06:12.220
Who are you?

06:12.400 --> 06:14.400
A lackey sucking up to the powerful.

06:14.650 --> 06:16.200
A freeloading son-in-law.

06:16.470 --> 06:17.350
Or perhaps,

06:17.560 --> 06:18.760
you're both.

06:19.080 --> 06:19.920
What are you talking about?

06:19.920 --> 06:21.210
I-I don't understand.

06:21.480 --> 06:22.760
But you had better know this:

06:22.760 --> 06:25.310
My wife is the Prime Minister's daughter!

06:25.440 --> 06:26.570
This is the capital.

06:26.600 --> 06:28.880
How dare you commit violence here?

06:28.900 --> 06:30.540
Commit violence?

06:30.960 --> 06:32.220
It seems you've forgotten

06:32.220 --> 06:35.680
how Shen Nian'an was killed by you here.

06:44.840 --> 06:46.680
You are talking nonsense!

06:46.700 --> 06:48.320
If you don't want anyone to know,

06:48.320 --> 06:49.950
don't do it in the first place.

06:49.950 --> 06:51.360
Did you really think you could cover up

06:51.360 --> 06:54.280
what you've done?

06:55.880 --> 06:57.480
How could you possibly know?

06:57.560 --> 06:59.340
Could it be that bitch Yang?

07:11.670 --> 07:12.740
Nian'an,

07:14.320 --> 07:16.000
if your spirit is watching from heaven,

07:16.000 --> 07:17.360
watch closely.

07:19.880 --> 07:20.680
Today,

07:21.840 --> 07:23.720
justice will be served for you!

07:26.160 --> 07:28.830
Please let me go.

07:29.040 --> 07:30.200
Please.

07:30.200 --> 07:31.200
Let you go?

07:31.960 --> 07:34.080
You will die the exact same way

07:34.100 --> 07:35.560
Shen Nian'an did.

07:35.780 --> 07:36.560
No.

07:37.430 --> 07:39.190
You'll pay back double.

07:39.320 --> 07:40.960
You've got it wrong.

07:41.120 --> 07:43.620
I didn't kill Shen Nian'an!

07:44.880 --> 07:45.520
It was

07:45.560 --> 07:46.970
Prime Minister Lin

07:47.050 --> 07:49.610
who insisted on killing him.

07:49.640 --> 07:51.540
It has nothing to do with me!

07:51.640 --> 07:54.190
Shen Nian'an was Prime Minister Lin's
honored son-in-law.

07:54.190 --> 07:55.440
For no reason,

07:55.440 --> 07:58.159
why would he kill Shen Nian'an?

07:58.440 --> 08:00.480
You must have instigated

08:00.760 --> 08:02.000
and bewitched the Prime Minister Lin.

08:02.000 --> 08:03.160
That's not true.

08:03.160 --> 08:04.120
That's not true.

08:04.440 --> 08:05.520
Shen Nian'an

08:05.680 --> 08:07.630
was investigating Lingya Tower

08:07.880 --> 08:08.640
and found out

08:09.000 --> 08:11.130
that Prime Minister Lin was involved.

08:15.000 --> 08:18.280
What is the relation between
Prime Minister Lin and Lingya Tower?

08:18.280 --> 08:20.520
I don't know!

08:24.600 --> 08:25.720
All I know is

08:26.080 --> 08:29.880
that Prime Minister Lin has always
had dealings with Lingya Tower.

08:30.240 --> 08:31.920
Many officials in the court

08:32.120 --> 08:34.240
were also introduced
by Prime Minister Lin.

08:34.240 --> 08:36.559
I knew this matter involved many people,

08:36.640 --> 08:39.400
so I kept advising Shen Nian'an

08:39.400 --> 08:40.720
not to dig any deeper.

08:41.039 --> 08:42.640
But he wouldn't listen,

08:43.159 --> 08:45.520
insisted on handling it impartially.

08:48.160 --> 08:50.360
You know how to wash your hands of guilt,
don't you?

08:50.360 --> 08:52.480
Shen Nian'an investigating Lingya Tower,

08:52.480 --> 08:53.640
if no one had reported it,

08:53.640 --> 08:55.360
how would Prime Minister Lin have known?

08:55.360 --> 08:57.280
You must have sold him out

08:57.400 --> 08:59.110
to curry favor with Prime Minister Lin.

08:59.110 --> 09:00.440
No, it wasn't like that.

09:00.720 --> 09:01.600
Listen to me.

09:01.640 --> 09:04.060
Prime Minister Lin has eyes and ears
all over the court.

09:04.060 --> 09:06.120
How could Shen Nian'an's investigation

09:06.120 --> 09:08.000
possibly escape his notice?

09:08.380 --> 09:09.770
Think about it, right?

09:09.860 --> 09:13.250
Prime Minister Lin found out
that Shen Nian'an held

09:13.390 --> 09:14.610
a detailed ledger of

09:14.680 --> 09:17.640
the gold flowing into Lingya Tower.

09:18.320 --> 09:19.840
That's why he came to me,

09:19.880 --> 09:22.040
wanting my help to get the ledger.

09:22.230 --> 09:23.070
Oh.

09:25.520 --> 09:27.220
So it was you

09:27.610 --> 09:29.680
who tricked Shen Nian'an into coming here

09:29.680 --> 09:31.330
and forced him to hand over the ledger.

09:31.330 --> 09:32.490
Where is the ledger now?

09:32.490 --> 09:35.080
Of course Prime Minister Lin took it.

09:35.480 --> 09:38.880
It seems keeping you alive is useless.

09:39.540 --> 09:41.620
Wait, wait! No, no, no!

09:41.650 --> 09:43.150
Don't kill me.

09:43.200 --> 09:45.120
I know where the thing you want is.

09:50.280 --> 09:52.210
Inside Prime Minister Lin's room,

09:52.560 --> 09:54.020
there is a secret chamber.

09:54.670 --> 09:56.230
Shen Nian'an's ledger

09:57.000 --> 09:58.200
is kept right there!

10:16.320 --> 10:18.320
The sound from this wall is strange.

10:18.340 --> 10:20.820
The secret chamber must be right here.

10:28.600 --> 10:29.520
Master, look.

10:29.640 --> 10:31.100
There are scratches on it.

10:36.430 --> 10:37.580
The secret chamber.

10:48.860 --> 10:51.920
Why are there so many gold coins
from Lingya Tower here?

10:58.690 --> 10:59.490
Ah!

10:59.700 --> 11:01.640
[Blueprint Collection of Lingya Tower]

10:59.750 --> 11:00.550
This...

11:03.040 --> 11:03.170
[Patterns]

11:03.360 --> 11:04.710
[Gate] [Fence]

11:04.240 --> 11:07.900
This is the design draft my father drew
for Lingya Tower years ago.

11:15.530 --> 11:17.180
It really is him.

11:19.930 --> 11:21.150
What's wrong, Master?

11:21.150 --> 11:23.150
Every noble who enters Lingya Tower

11:23.880 --> 11:25.860
has their own unique mask.

11:26.120 --> 11:28.720
And this one belongs to Hei Ya.

11:29.430 --> 11:30.630
Are you saying

11:33.160 --> 11:35.020
that Prime Minister Lin is Hei Ya?

11:36.080 --> 11:36.880
Yes.

11:51.190 --> 11:52.150
Heroine.

11:52.970 --> 11:54.690
I wasn't lying, was I?

11:55.560 --> 11:58.280
I was truly forced into this.

11:58.680 --> 12:01.560
Please let me go.

12:06.070 --> 12:08.550
Jingjing, why is it you?

12:08.570 --> 12:10.130
Every single thing you did

12:10.600 --> 12:12.330
and every single word you said,

12:12.370 --> 12:13.770
I heard it all.

12:13.790 --> 12:14.750
Jingjing.

12:15.200 --> 12:17.360
It's not what it sounded like.

12:17.360 --> 12:20.020
What I said today was just
an expedient measure.

12:20.080 --> 12:22.020
If my life wasn't at stake,

12:22.280 --> 12:24.160
I would never have done this.

12:24.520 --> 12:26.920
I thought you were just a hypocrite,

12:26.960 --> 12:28.200
a power-hungry sycophant.

12:28.200 --> 12:29.800
But I didn't expect

12:30.080 --> 12:32.010
you to bite the hand that feeds you.

12:33.000 --> 12:34.680
You are worse than a beast!

12:35.520 --> 12:36.320
Jingjing,

12:36.440 --> 12:37.480
listen to me.

12:37.500 --> 12:38.300
Liu Yuan.

12:38.670 --> 12:41.530
You can treat me as a stepping stone
to your success.

12:42.570 --> 12:44.100
But your fatal mistake

12:44.810 --> 12:46.840
was harming my Nian'an.

12:48.600 --> 12:49.680
Today,

12:51.660 --> 12:54.130
I will avenge my Nian'an
with my own hands.

13:00.540 --> 13:01.340
Master.

13:02.000 --> 13:03.480
The death match for the Lantern Festival

13:03.480 --> 13:05.080
is fully prepared.

13:05.200 --> 13:06.860
Bets can be opened at any time.

13:07.110 --> 13:10.020
No rush.
Our honored guests have yet to arrive.

13:10.490 --> 13:11.490
Wait a bit longer.

13:11.760 --> 13:12.240
Yes.
